WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.230
Block the outlet of a
bicycle pump with your thumb.

2
00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:06.280
Push the handle in, hard and fast.

3
00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:09.470
The air inside is squashed
into a smaller space.

4
00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:10.740
It warms up.

5
00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:14.320
No flame, no heater,
nothing hot touched it.

6
00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:16.930
So where did that extra energy come from?

7
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.580
In this mission, you'll meet
the first law of thermodynamics:

8
00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:23.320
conservation of energy for a gas.

9
00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:27.680
Then you'll learn to read the signs:
when a gas gains internal energy,

10
00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:29.200
and when it loses it.

11
00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:34.190
Your mission: find out where the energy
that warms the squashed gas comes from.
